<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE - Hanjin Heavy posts H1 profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Hanjin Heavy posts H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			 (profit)  234 vs (loss) 251</p>
<p>    Net				 (profit) 7.81 vs (loss)   7.20</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	     (profit) 9.81 vs (loss)   7.20</p>
<p>    Turnover				   312.41 vs	  273.88</p>
<p>Note - Hanjin Heavy Industries Co Ltd is a unit of South Korea's Hanjin Group. The Korea Listed Companies Association provided the figures but gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
